<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South Africa's IDC signs 250 mln Eurorand loan.</title>
<headline>South Africa's IDC signs 250 mln Eurorand loan.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Industrial Development Corp (IDC) said on Friday it had signed a 250 million rand, five-year Eurorand term loan facility with Rabobank and Commerzbank AG.</p>
<p>The loan, which will be funded by Rabobank, is the second Eurorand loan entered into by the IDC.  </p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to partially fund the IDC's investments in capital projects and would also be channelled into funding small- and medium-sized enterprises.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
